==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Fletchinder|28}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Fletchinder|31}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Steady Firebreathing''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Magma's Houndour|63}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

